## Review verdicts

> Written by the reviewer only. PASS or CHANGES_REQUESTED, then numbered
> findings with file:line and severity.
>
> **Pass 2 closes Pass 1 by number** — every earlier finding marked fixed,
> withdrawn, disputed (answering the implementer's Decisions-log reason), or
> routed to test. A finding about code the diff did not change is admissible
> on Pass 2 only at `critical` or `high`: without that rule the two-loop cap
> stops being a convergence guarantee and becomes an arbitrary cutoff.

